BEE_BRAIN_MODEL:
    Waggle dance → Symbolic communication
    Swarm intelligence → Quorum sensing
    
    USE FOR: CPL communication, consensus protocols

CROW_BRAIN_MODEL:
    Tool use circuits → Meta-cognition
    Future planning → Temporal navigation
    
